  body: |
    # ESA work-related activity and its work boundary

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source distinguishes work-related activity from ordinary paid or unpaid work, differentiates a required work placement from voluntary work experience, and restricts what may be required.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 53071–53077 do not authorise requiring employment, a job application or medical treatment. Requirement scope, reasonableness, exemptions, support-group status and later legal changes must be checked; no sanction decision follows from this concept.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 53071, PDF page 16](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=16)
    - [DMG 53072, PDF page 16](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=16)
    - [DMG 53073, PDF page 16](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=16)
    - [DMG 53077, PDF page 17](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=17)
    - [DMG 53080, PDF page 17](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=17)
    - [DMG 53081, PDF page 17](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=17)

    ## Evidence and review status

    This is an unreviewed, model-assisted interpretation of selected passages in the frozen DWP guidance. It is an independent experimental publication, not an official DWP document, an entitlement decision or an executable benefits rule. ESA(Cont), ESA(IR), New Style ESA, UC and Pension Credit are not equated. The captured source contains historical, transitional and potentially superseded provisions; no complete or current legal rule set is claimed. Machine extraction can affect reading order, footnotes and characters. No visual PDF review or specialist acceptance is claimed.

